<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>There are various issues with the lightmapper creating odd shadows, and black artifacts, particularly along chunk boundaries. 
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Workarounds">Workarounds</span></h2>
<p>The latest version of the lightmapper is available now at <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://social.bioware.com/project/717/">the Lightmapper project</a>.  It seems to solve many of the previous issues.  It can be downloaded and installed over top of your existing lightmapper files
</p><p>The latest lightmapper files are included with version 1.01 of the toolset installer as well.
</p>
